    "en": {
      "trackName": "10 Minigames for Watch & Phone",
      "description": "10 Minigames for Watch & Phone is a colorful collection of quick games built for short sessions and easy pick-up-and-play fun. Jump into racers, quizzes, pong-style matches, reflex challenges, arcade action, and more from one app. Switch between different game styles, unlock extra content, and keep the fun going on iPhone and Apple Watch.\n\n10 Minigames for Watch & Phone includes the following games:\n- Ping Pong (up to four players on one device!)\n- Tic Tac Toe\n- Saw Master! Ultimate\n\nUnlock:\n- Cactus vs. Dino 3D: Jump game\n- Moto Race: Oncoming Fury\n- Dino Merge: Idle Clicker\n- Mediocre Manfredo: Jump'n'run\n- Night Racer: Car Crash\n- Super Flags! Flag Quiz\n- Super Maps! Map Quiz\n- Four in a Row\n- Monster Truck: Car Smash\n- Nodoku - It's not Sudoku\n\nYep, that's actually 13 games.\n\nAll games can be played offline without internet connection.",
